^{:go/end 224} (go/method MarshalASN1 "MarshalASN1 calls encoding_asn1.Marshal on its input and appends the result if\nsuccessful or records an error if one occurred.\n" [^{:tag (* Builder)} b ^{:tag (interface)} v]
